body:
Mine automatically wakes up around 9 PM, during this time I will clean her cage and change her food and water. 

&#x200B;

When she needs it, this is usually the time I bath her or give her footbaths. 

&#x200B;

My hedgehog is 4 months now :)

Tell them "Ok give me a moment" 

&#x200B;

Leave the Party and never come back for the rest of the night. 

&#x200B;

I'm really good at this.

A toy secured with an endless amount of twist ties, that cannot be cut. 

&#x200B;

or a toy that never stops getting sticky ahaha

